<title>Hydatidiform Mole: Management.</title>
<graphic href="eee0469-w001.gif" />
<cell type="start" id="cell-1">
<label>First trimester bleeding</label>
<path target="cell-2"></path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-2">
<label>History &amp; Physical: hyperemesis, uterine size &#x2260; dates, gestational HTN, or signs of thyrotoxicosis?</label>
<path target="cell-3">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-4">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-3">
<label>Consider hydatidiform mole; obtain ultrasound. Ultrasound normal?</label>
<path target="cell-4">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-6">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-6">
<label>Placental abnormality consistent with molar pregnancy?</label>
<path target="cell-8">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-9">Other abnormality</path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-8">
<label>Obtain quantitative beta-HCG result.</label>
<path target="cell-10">Normal or equivocal</path>
<path target="cell-13">Low</path>
<path target="cell-15">High</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-10">
<label>Repeat beta-HCG and reassess with ultrasound.</label>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-13">
<label>Consider partial mole vs. spontaneous abortion.</label>
<path target="cell-14"></path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-14">
<label>D&amp;C.</label>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-15">
<label>Consider complete mole.</label>
<path target="cell-14"></path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-9">
<label>Manage other problem.</label>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-4">
<label>Continue work-up for other causes of first trimester bleeding.</label>
</cell>
</algorithm>
